# Change Management
Rule Type: Prompt
Prompts: change trading logic, modify strategy, update groq_recommendations

## Core Principles
- Make incremental changes only
- No major strategy logic changes
- Focus changes on groq_recommendations_strategy.py
- Maintain backward compatibility

## Change Process
### 1. Pre-Change Requirements
- Document current behavior
- Identify specific areas for change
- Review existing test coverage
- Plan validation approach

### 2. Implementation Steps
1. Document current behavior
2. Make minimal necessary changes
3. Test changes in all modes
4. Verify consistency across modes
5. Update documentation

### 3. Validation Requirements
- Run backtest before and after
- Compare watch mode behavior
- Verify realtime behavior
- Validate all modes produce consistent results

## Change Restrictions
### Core Logic
- No changes to entry/exit logic without full review
- No changes to risk management without approval
- No changes to signal generation without testing
- No mode-specific logic changes

### Risk Management
- No changes to stop loss parameters without approval
- No changes to target profit parameters without approval
- No changes to position sizing without review
- No changes to risk per trade without approval

### Signal Generation
- No changes to indicator calculations without testing
- No changes to zone identification without validation
- No changes to signal parameters without review
- No changes to timing logic without approval

## Documentation Requirements
### Change Documentation
- Document all changes to entry/exit logic
- Update mode-specific documentation
- Maintain change log
- Document validation results

### Validation Documentation
- Document backtest results
- Document watch mode behavior
- Document realtime performance
- Maintain comparison logs

## Review Process
### Code Review
- Peer review required for all changes
- Security review for IBKR interactions
- Performance review for realtime operations
- Strategy logic review for all changes

### Testing Review
- Unit test coverage review
- Integration test review
- Performance test review
- Security test review

## Deployment Process
### Pre-Deployment
- Run full test suite
- Verify all modes
- Check documentation
- Review change log

### Post-Deployment
- Monitor performance
- Track error rates
- Validate signals
- Update metrics

## Emergency Procedures
### Rollback Process
- Maintain backup of previous version
- Document rollback procedure
- Test rollback process
- Monitor post-rollback behavior

### Emergency Changes
- Document emergency change process
- Define approval requirements
- Specify validation steps
- Maintain audit trail
